{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"505324","name":"丛山锻火驰行","desc":"丛山锻火驰行卡牌","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/05/06/258999284/948de7cc9342fabe613ec2ab1a4c7fd8_8053426705978558040.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"基础信息\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"name\":\"丛山锻火驰行\",\"common_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/05/06/258999284/948de7cc9342fabe613ec2ab1a4c7fd8_3345062314156566314.png\",\"gold_img\":\"\",\"life\":2,\"life_bg\":7,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"类型：\",\"value\":[\"装备牌\"]},{\"key\":\"标签：\",\"value\":[\"天赋\"]},{\"key\":\"获取：\",\"value\":[\"猫尾酒馆对战获取\"]},{\"key\":\"花费：\",\"value\":[\"2\"]}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}","style":""}],"id":"1","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"效果描述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e战斗行动\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;战斗行动：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;我方执行了一次战斗行动后，会轮到对方行动。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;打出具有此规则的手牌是一个战斗行动，而非快速行动。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e：我方出战角色为\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e希诺宁\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e时，装备此牌。\u003cbr\u003e希诺宁装备此牌后，立刻使用一次\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e音火锻淬\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;音火锻淬：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;元素战技\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;本角色附属\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;刃轮装束\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;，进入\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;夜魂加持\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;并获得1点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;「夜魂值」\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;。（角色进入\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;夜魂加持\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;后不可使用此技能）\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;（附属\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;刃轮装束\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;的角色可以使用特技：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;高速腾跃\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;）\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e装备有此牌的希诺宁\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e在场时：切换至希诺宁或由希诺宁切换至其他角色时，若目标处于\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e夜魂加持\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;夜魂加持：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;状态\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;所附属角色可累积\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;「夜魂值」\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;。（最多累积到2点）\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e状态，则回复1点夜魂值。（每回合2次）\u003cbr\u003e（牌组中包含希诺宁，才能加入牌组）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"2","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"卡牌故事","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e希诺宁·丛山锻火驰行\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「沸腾吧，山之血！」\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"6632","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"6633","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":